            <ArticleTitle>Cholecystocolonic fistula diagnosed with CT-intravenous cholangiography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>484-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cholecystoenteric fistulas are often not diagnosed preoperatively and delineation of fistula can have an influence on surgical planning. We report a case of cholecystocolonic fistula diagnosed preoperatively using CT-i.v. cholangiography and review the published reports.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
